        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"2488731\"\nprovider: resident_advisor\ntitle: \"FREE ENTRY: Live Music Jam Session & DJ Sets Community OPEN AIR \"\ndescription: \"Genres: House, Hip-Hop\\nJoin us for an inspiring & exciting Live Music Jam Session filled with welcoming atmosphere - in our new club location in the heart of Kreuzberg, at Kottbusser Tor - with a spacious indoor area, a stage to express Yourself & a large terrace create the perfect setting to connect, move & feel free.\\n\\nAll about community, music & collaboration. Whether You are a storyteller, musician, poet, dancer, or visual artist, this space welcomes every form of expression.\\n\\nEvery respectful person is invited.\\n\\nSET UP:\\nfor the Jam Session there is a full band set up available incl. Drums\\n\\nno need to bring Your own instruments\\n\\n...for more info check out DNA. ART CLUB Website / follow us on IG: @nightart.club\\n\\nSee You soon :)\\nLove.\\nDNA.\\n__________________\\n*This Workshop is free for DNA. Members\\n\\n**By entering the DNA. HOUSE / DNA. CLUB, You agree to comply with the Hausordnung of Dair Night Art e.V. and Geschäftsordnung of Dair Night Art e.V. Please ensure You review these documents thoroughly in advance.\"\nurl: \"https://ra.co/events/2488731\"\ndate_start: \"2026-07-30T19:00:00.000\"\ndate_end: \"2026-07-30T23:59:00.000\"\ntimezone: null\nevent_type: PHYSICAL\nvenue_name: DNA. CLUB - urban Space\nvenue_address: \"Adalbertstraße 98, 10999 Berlin\"\nvenue_city: Berlin\nvenue_state: null\nvenue_country: null\nvenue_lat: 0\nvenue_lon: 0\norganizer_name: DNA. ART\norganizer_slug: null\norganizer_id: null\nrsvp_count: 43\nis_paid: true\nfee_amount: \"0.00\"\nfee_currency: EUR\nimage_url: \"https://images.ra.co/0e4147a5a0aec1e72751b50f37f90efc66d9400a.png\"\nartists: null\ngenres: House|Hip-Hop\nminimum_age: 18\nis_festival: false\nhash: 2d1e853a17914a80\nembed_ref: free-entry-live-FDV\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
