        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"315829871\"\nprovider: meetup\ntitle: Friday Morning Creative Hour\ndescription: \"# Own your Friday mornings ☀\\n\\nLet's start our Fridays strong.\\nLet's wrap up that pending chore or just immerse ourselves in what we love but keep putting away.\\nLet's work on what matters to us - but in a community.\\n\\nFriday Morning Creative Hour is a relaxed virtual co-working session where everyone brings their own project. . The focus is on creating space for deep, uninterrupted work in the company of others.\\n\\n### What to expect\\n\\n**☕ Check-in (5–10 min)**\\n\\n* Say hello.\\n* Set a simple intention: *What will you work on/finish today?*\\n\\n**🎯 Focus Session (60 min)**\\n\\n* Cameras on or off—your choice.\\n* Microphones muted.\\n* Quiet, dedicated time to work on your own project.\\n\\n**💬 Wrap-up (10–15 min)**\\n\\n* Share how the session unfolded for you: what worked and what next.\\n* Celebrate small wins together.\\n* Give yourself credit for showing up and doing the work.\\n\\n### Bring anything you want to work on\\n\\nSome of the things you can do:\\n\\n* Creative writing\\n* Drawing or illustration\\n* Coding\\n* Learning a new skill\\n* Knitting or stitiching\\n* Business planning\\n* Tax returns or paperwork (not creative, but it frees up mental space)\\n* Email and admin tasks\\n* Journaling or planning\\n\\nThis is not a reading group.\\n\\nIt's a group where we help each other stay focused and work on out tasks.\\n\\nThe idea is to be intentional and take charge of what's important to us.\\n\\nGrab your favorite morning drink, set an intention, and let's create together :)\"\nurl: \"https://www.meetup.com/berlin-writes-berlin-makes/events/315829871/\"\ndate_start: \"2026-07-31T07:20:00+02:00\"\ndate_end: \"2026-07-31T08:50:00+02:00\"\ntimezone: Europe/Berlin\nevent_type: ONLINE\nvenue_name: Online event\nvenue_address: \"\"\nvenue_city: \"\"\nvenue_state: \"\"\nvenue_country: \"\"\nvenue_lat: -8.521147\nvenue_lon: 179.1962\norganizer_id: \"38420786\"\norganizer_name: \"Berlin Writes, Berlin Makes\"\norganizer_slug: berlin-writes-berlin-makes\nrsvp_count: 2\nis_paid: false\nfee: null\nimage_url: \"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/f/9/f/highres_535216287.jpeg\"\nhash: 65044afe12017148\nembed_ref: friday-morning-creative-q36\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
