        "content": "type: event_result\nid: \"315664968\"\nprovider: meetup\ntitle: \"Pick the right tool: Claude Code or Cowork\"\ndescription: \"**What you'll learn:**\\n\\n* ***/loop, /schedule, Routines, Dispatch***\\n* ***Bust the technical vs. non-technical myth***\\n\\nDiscover why \\\"Code is for developers, Cowork for everyone else\\\" is outdated, and what actually separates them today.\\n\\n* ***Choose your automation: Routines vs Scheduled Tasks***\\n\\nCompare Claude Code's /loop, /schedule & Routines vs Cowork's Scheduled Tasks & Dispatch to pick the right one.\\n\\n* ***Test both tools on the same real task***\\n\\nRun the same scenario in Code and Cowork live, side by side, and walk away with a decision framework instead of a guess.\\n\\n**Why this topic matters:**\\nClaude Code began as a coding CLI and Cowork as a file automator, but both have evolved past their origins. Code now runs full automations, and Cowork is catching up. The old technical vs. non-technical split is dead. So, when do you use which? We'll test both tools live on the same real-world scenarios so you leave with a concrete decision framework instead of a guess.\"\nurl: \"https://www.meetup.com/baig-academy-of-ai/events/315664968/\"\ndate_start: \"2026-07-31T19:30:00+02:00\"\ndate_end: \"2026-07-31T20:30:00+02:00\"\ntimezone: Europe/Berlin\nevent_type: ONLINE\nvenue_name: Online event\nvenue_address: \"\"\nvenue_city: \"\"\nvenue_state: \"\"\nvenue_country: \"\"\nvenue_lat: -8.521147\nvenue_lon: 179.1962\norganizer_id: \"37964534\"\norganizer_name: Baig Academy of AI\norganizer_slug: baig-academy-of-ai\nrsvp_count: 50\nis_paid: false\nfee: null\nimage_url: \"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/8/c/2/highres_535191394.jpeg\"\nhash: d2e36904aa19e133\nembed_ref: pick-the-right-K35\napp_id: events\nskill_id: search",
